  "id": "cingulotomy",
  "term": "cingulotomy",
  "definition": "Cingulotomy is a neurosurgical lesion procedure discussed as a clinically effective intervention for obsessive-compulsive disorder. In this context, it is used to help relate OCD symptoms to the brain circuits involved in the disorder.",
